# Nimadir's registry (apps.json at commit ee1e1ab), in its apps.list form:
#   name | source | description

store | mini-apps/store/store.component.wasm | The start page: browse and search everything below.
counter | mini-apps/counter/counter.component.wasm | A counter; the count lives inside the guest.
hello | mini-apps/hello/hello.component.wasm | A second app, to show hot-swap with no host rebuild.
gallery | mini-apps/gallery/gallery.component.wasm | Every widget an app can draw, and what each answers back.
rates | mini-apps/rates/rates.component.wasm | Exchange rates from the Central Bank of Uzbekistan, with a converter.
counter-cs | mini-apps/counter-cs/counter-cs.component.wasm | The counter written in C# (.NET NativeAOT) - same WIT, no host change.
counter-py | mini-apps/counter-py/counter-py.component.wasm | The counter in Python - a whole CPython inside the sandbox.
showcase | mini-apps/showcase/showcase.component.wasm | The element tree in full: a grid of cards, a live form, type and theme - HTML and CSS, drawn natively.
todo | mini-apps/todo/todo.component.wasm | A to-do list on the element tree: add, tick, delete.
